{"projectInfo":{"name":"IPv4网络访问IPv6 Internet中的服务器配置","path":"aft4","visibility":2,"categoryId":33,"introduction":"Internet已经升级到了IPv6，但是某公司内部网络仍然是IPv4网络。而该公司内部网络的10.1.1.0/24网段的用户仍需要访问IPv6 Internet中的服务器，其他用户不能访问。为满足上述要求，本例中使用如下方式实现：使用IPv4到IPv6源地址动态地址转换策略，将IPv4报文的源地址转换为IPv6地址。通过IPv6到IPv4的源地址静态转换策略为IPv6 Internet上服务器的IPv6地址指定一个对应的IPv4地址，Router收到发往该IPv4地址的报文时将其转换为对应的IPv6地址。","label":["AFT"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"IPv4-Host-A","resourceCategory":"终端设备","resourceModel":"PC","resourceVersion":"","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\IPv4-Host-A.cfg"},{"resourceName":"IPv4-Host-B","resourceCategory":"终端设备","resourceModel":"PC","resourceVersion":"","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\IPv4-Host-B.cfg"},{"resourceName":"SW","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S5820V2-54QS-GE","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.075-A7571","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SW.cfg"},{"resourceName":"IPv6-Server","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\IPv6-Server.cfg"},{"resourceName":"Router","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\Router.cfg"}]}